{title: Tomar Jonno}
{artist: Arnob}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A] Tomar jonno [E] nilche tara,        [F#m] ektu khani [D] alo
[A] vorer rong [E] rate mise [F#m] kalo [D],        [A] kath golaper [E] sada maya
[F#m] mishiye diye [D] vabi,        [A] abcha nil [E] tomar lage [F#m] valo [D]
[A] Tmar jonno [E] nilche tara,        [F#m] ektu khani [D] alo
[A] vorer rong [E] rate mise [F#m] kalo [D],        [A] kath golaper [E] sada maya
[F#m] mishiye diye [D] vabi,        [A] abcha nil [E] tomar lage [F#m] valo [D]
[A] vabna amar [E] shimul dale,        [F#m] lalche agun [D] jale
[A] mohuwar bone [E] matal hawa [F#m] khele [D],        [A] ek mutho rod [E] akash vora tara
[F#m] vije matite [D] joler noksha kora,        [A] mon ke sudhu [E] pagol kore [F#m] fele [D]
[A] tomay ghire [E] ato gulo rat,        [F#m] odhir hoye jege [D] thaka
[A] tomay ghire [E] amar valo [F#m] laga [D],        [A] akash vora [E] tarar aloy
[F#m] tomay dekhe [D] dekhe,        [A] valobashar [E] pakhi mele
mon vola [F#m] no pakha [E],        [A] vabna amar [E] shimul dale
[F#m] lalche agun [D] jale,        [A] mohuwar bone [E] matal hawa [F#m] khele [D]
